{"u": "10767876753", "name": "Martial Arts World [🎃HALLOWEEN]", "place": "81839945715364", "created": "2026-09-24", "updated": "2026-11-09T15:44:40.556Z", "genre": "RPG", "subgenre": "Action RPG", "desc": "⚠️ PRIVATE SERVERS ARE MOVED TO INGAME MENUS AS CODE-BASED JOINING TO ACCOMMODATE CONSOLE AND NEW REGIONS ⚠️\n\nThis is a Parry-based Cultivation Murim Fighting RPG Game, with increased difficulty\n\nEnter the Murim as an unknown martial artist. Train your body, cultivate your qi, and pursue strength beyond mortal limits. The path to mastery is unforgiving, and not every battle is yours to win.\nFight with fists or steel. Read your opponent, parry their strikes, and turn an opening into victory. Reckless attacks leave you exposed; strength alone will not save you.\n\nFace dangerous qi beasts and rival martial artists. Learn from defeat, refine your techniques, and overcome those who once stood beyond your reach.\nTemper your body. Sharpen your blade. Forge your path.\n\nCODES ON INGAME MENU\n\nCONTROLLER/MOBILE ✓\n\nKEYBINDS\nM1 / Left Click - Light Attack\nM2 / Right Click - Heavy Attack\nF - Parry\nQ - Directional Dodge\nShift - Sprint\nAlt - Lock Camera\nT - Target Lock\nN - Map\nY - Execute\nSpace - Jump", "desc_hash": "2816c24e3ad8", "max_players": 20, "vip": false, "price": null, "avatar": "MorphToR15", "visits": 1479427, "favorites": 18941, "creator": {"id": 410507156, "name": "Tayara Studios", "type": "Group", "verified": false}, "daily": {"2026-10-24": {"updated": "2026-10-24T13:59:19.056Z", "visits": 477302, "fav": 9161, "up": 10967, "down": 326}, "2026-10-25": {"updated": "2026-10-25T16:44:21.803Z", "visits": 539030, "fav": 10207, "up": 12518, "down": 353}, "2026-10-26": {"updated": "2026-10-26T15:47:14.148Z", "visits": 600758, "fav": 11105, "up": 13419, "down": 373}, "2026-10-27": {"updated": "2026-10-27T11:09:34.7Z", "visits": 656612, "fav": 11712, "up": 13608, "down": 400}, "2026-10-28": {"updated": "2026-10-28T16:57:51.431Z", "visits": 715329, "fav"